l) to the Annual General Meeting 2027","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/nomination-committee-for-roko-ab-publ-to-the-annual-general-meeting-2027","tags":["ci","ci:nomination"]},{"date":"2026-10-14T07:00","title":"Valberedning för Röko AB (publ) inför årsstämman 2027","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/valberedning-for-roko-ab-publ-infor-arsstamman-2027","tags":["ci","ci:nomination"]},{"date":"2026-08-04T12:00","title":"Röko acquires CyTech in Italy","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/roko-acquires-cytech-in-italy","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-08-04T12:00","title":"Röko förvärvar CyTech i Italien","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/roko-forvarvar-cytech-i-italien","tags":["ci","ci:other"]},{"date":"2026-07-17T06:00","title":"Interim report 1 January – 30 June 2026","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/interim-report-1-january-30-june-2026","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q2"]},{"date":"2026-07-17T06:00","title":"Delårsrapport 1 januari – 30 juni 2026","url":"https://mfn.se/a/roko-ab/delarsrapport-1-januari-30-juni-2026","tags":["report","report:interim","report:interim:q2"]}],"events":[{"date":"2026-10-23","title":"Delårsrapport 1 januari – 30 september 2026","text":"Stockholm den 23 oktober 2026 * I det tredje kvartalet ökade Adj. EBITA med 57% till 433 MSEK (275), drivet av förvärv, organisk tillväxt och med positiva valutakurseffekter. Adj. EBITA marginalen ökade till 20% (18%) * Under niomånadersperioden ökade Adj. EBITA med 30% till 1 275 MSEK (983), drivet av förvärv och organisk tillväxt men med negativa valutakurseffekter. Adj. EBITA marginalen uppgick till 21% (21%) * Net debt / LTM Adj. EBITDA ökade till 2,6x (2,1x) vid slutet av perioden, drivet av förvärv som konsoliderats under perioden * Fem bolag med en sammanlagd årsomsättning om 1 543 MSEK förvärvades och konsoliderades under niomånadersperioden Vänligen se rapporten för mer information. För frågor, vänligen kontakta: Andreas Larsson, Investor Relations Röko, +46 (0) 709 707 555, ir@roko.se Röko är en evig ägare av europeiska små och medelstora företag och har genomfört mer än 40 förvärv sedan starten 2019. Vårt team har mer än 100 års kombinerad erfarenhet av att arbeta med ägarledda företag inom ett brett spektrum av branscher. Denna information är sådan information som Röko AB (publ) är skyldigt att offentliggöra enligt EU:s marknadsmissbruksförordning. Informationen lämnades, genom ovanstående kontaktpersoners försorg, för offentliggörande den 2026-10-23 08:00 CEST. Bifogade filer ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 261023 Röko Delårsrapport Q32026 Final (https://storage.mfn.se/145548d3-0c30-4290-ab30-4aede238dc47/261023-roko-delarsrapport-q32026-final.pdf) Röko 26Q3 Presentation VF (https://storage.mfn.se/d9e61004-9d52-45ed-9699-4f7e3c757842/roko-26q3-presentation-vf.pdf)"},{"date":"2026-10-23","title":"Interim report 1 January – 30 September 2026","text":"Stockholm, October 23, 2026 * In the third quarter Adj. EBITA increased 57% to MSEK 433 (275), driven by acquisitions, organic growth and with positive exchange rate differences. The Adj. EBITA margin increased to 20% (18%) * For the nine-month period Adj. EBITA increased 30% to MSEK 1,275 (983) in the period driven by acquisitions and organic growth, but with negative exchange rate differences. The Adj. EBITA margin was 21% (21%) * Net debt / LTM Adj. EBITDA increased to 2.6x (2.1x) at the end of the period, driven by acquisitions consolidated in the period * Five companies with combined annual sales of MSEK 1,543 were acquired and consolidated in the nine-months period Please see the report for more information. In case you have any questions, please contact: Andreas Larsson, Investor Relations Röko, +46 (0) 709 707 555, ir@roko.se Röko is a perpetual owner of European small- and medium-sized businesses and have completed more than 40 acquisitions since the start in 2019. Our team has more than 100 years of combined experience working with owner-managed businesses across a broad range of industries. This information is information that Röko AB (publ) is obliged to make public pursuant to the EU Market Abuse Regulation. The information was submitted for publication, through the agency of the contact persons set out above, at 2026-10-23 08:00 CEST. Attachments ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 261023 Röko Interim Report Q32026 Final (https://storage.mfn.se/17623568-9183-48c2-a052-5af33ed7aed4/261023-roko-interim-report-q32026-final.pdf) Röko 26Q3 Presentation VF (https://storage.mfn.se/0802d974-e534-4676-b571-51a6413084bc/roko-26q3-presentation-vf.pdf)"}],"insider":[{"date":"2026-10-27","published":"2026-10-27","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Tomas Gunnar Billing","role":"Styrelseordförande","related":false,"volume":100.0,"price":1938.0,"currency":"SEK","value":193800.0},{"date":"2026-10-26","published":"2026-10-27","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Tomas Gunnar Billing","role":"Styrelseordförande","related":false,"volume":1682.0,"price":1937.0,"currency":"SEK","value":3258034.0},{"date":"2026-08-04","published":"2026-08-05","kind":"Avyttring","person":"Douglas Kressner","role":"Ekonomichef/finanschef/finansdirektör","related":false,"volume":390.0,"price":1896.0,"currency":"SEK","value":739440.0},{"date":"2026-07-20","published":"2026-07-20","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Johan Bladh","role":"Verkställande direktör (VD)","related":true,"volume":106.0,"price":1880.0,"currency":"SEK","value":199280.0},{"date":"2026-07-20","published":"2026-07-20","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Johan Bladh","role":"Verkställande direktör (VD)","related":false,"volume":850.0,"price":1874.0,"currency":"SEK","value":1592900.0},{"date":"2025-11-12","published":"2025-11-12","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Tomas Gunnar Billing","role":"Styrelseordförande","related":false,"volume":1300.0,"price":1773.95,"currency":"SEK","value":2306135.0},{"date":"2025-11-11","published":"2025-11-11","kind":"Förvärv","person":"Johan